    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../Parser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Parser</code></a> implementation for a JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/temporal/TemporalAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.temporal\"><code>TemporalAccessor</code></a>,\nusing a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a> (the contextual one, if available).",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../Parser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Parser</code></a> 实现用于 JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/temporal/TemporalAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.temporal\"><code>TemporalAccessor</code></a>，使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>（如果可用则使用上下文相关的）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../Printer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Printer</code></a> implementation for a JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/temporal/TemporalAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.temporal\"><code>TemporalAccessor</code></a>,\nusing a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>) (the contextual one, if available).",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../Printer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Printer</code></a> 实现用于 JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/temporal/TemporalAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.temporal\"><code>TemporalAccessor</code></a>，使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>（如果可用则使用上下文中的那个）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> that creates a JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> 用于创建 JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Support <code>Duration</code> parsing and printing in several styles, as listed in\n<a href=\"../../annotation/DurationFormat.Style.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DurationFormat.Style</code></a>.",
      "translation": "支持以多种格式解析和打印 `Duration`，具体格式如 <a href=\"../../annotation/DurationFormat.Style.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DurationFormat.Style</code></a> 中所列。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../Formatter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Formatter</code></a> implementation for a JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>,\nfollowing JSR-310's parsing rules for an Instant (that is, not using a\nconfigurable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>): accepting the\ndefault <code>ISO_INSTANT</code> format as well as <code>RFC_1123_DATE_TIME</code>\n(which is commonly used for HTTP date header values).",
      "translation": "`Formatter` 接口的实现，用于 JSR-310 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>`，遵循 JSR-310 对 Instant 的解析规则（即不使用可配置的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>`）：接受默认的 `<code>ISO_INSTANT</code>` 格式以及 `<code>RFC_1123_DATE_TIME</code>`（常用于 HTTP 日期标头值）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../Formatter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Formatter</code></a> implementation for a JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>,\nfollowing JSR-310's parsing rules for a Duration by default and\nsupporting additional <code>DurationFormat.Style</code> styles.",
      "translation": "`Formatter` 接口的实现，用于 JSR-310 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>，默认遵循 JSR-310 的 Duration 解析规则，并支持额外的<code>DurationFormat.Style</code>样式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Formats fields annotated with the <a href=\"../../annotation/DurationFormat.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DurationFormat</code></a> annotation using the\nselected style for parsing and printing JSR-310 <code>Duration</code>.",
      "translation": "使用所选样式解析和打印 JSR-310 `<code>Duration</code>`，以格式化带有<a href=\"../../annotation/DurationFormat.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DurationFormat</code></a> 注解的字段。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Formats fields annotated with the <a href=\"../../annotation/DateTimeFormat.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DateTimeFormat</code></a> annotation using the\nJSR-310 <code>java.time</code> package in JDK 8.",
      "translation": "使用 JDK 8 中的 JSR-310 `<code>java.time</code>` 包，格式化带有 `<a href=\"../../annotation/DateTimeFormat.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DateTimeFormat</code></a>` 注解的字段。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A holder for a thread-local user <a href=\"DateTimeContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.format.datetime.standard\"><code>DateTimeContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于线程本地用户<a href=\"DateTimeContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.format.datetime.standard\"><code>DateTimeContext</code></a>的持有者。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Factory that creates a JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建 JSR-310 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a> 的工厂。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Integration with the JSR-310 <code>java.time</code> package in JDK 8.",
      "translation": "与 JDK 8 中 JSR-310 `<code>java.time</code>` 包的集成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Formatters for <code>java.util.Date</code> properties.",
      "translation": "<code>java.util.Date</code> 属性的格式化器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A context that holds user-specific <code>java.time</code> (JSR-310) settings\nsuch as the user's Chronology (calendar system) and time zone.",
      "translation": "一个包含用户特定 `java.time`（JSR-310）设置的上下文，例如用户的历法（日历系统）和时区。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures the JSR-310 <code>java.time</code> formatting system for use with Spring.",
      "translation": "配置用于与 Spring 一起使用的 JSR-310 `<code>java.time</code>` 格式化系统。",
